      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/e9bcb4/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-01-21T05:07:04.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I don't think it will come close to WotC, mainly because of 1) price being higher and 2) a certain segment of the SotM fanbase who does not care for the Vengeance format. &nbsp;That being said, I would expect it would easily clear 3500 (and I could be way off) which I would assume would make it very successful considering the profit margin GTG makes from selling it directly from their store is much higher than any other sales</p>",
