      "created_at": "2015-01-21T05:08:42.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It would be really cool if we could turn this into a game, like \"The price is right\" If GTG would offer add a Promo card to the shipping of the winner.</p><p>Rules like:</p><p>1.You have to have a pre order</p><p>2.Only one guess per screan name</p><p>3.Only first posted guess counts, if someone else posts the same guess after they will have to edit it.</p><p>4. Like price is right winner is determined by closest to the number without going over.</p><p>5. GTG gets to pick what promo they will give to the winner</p><p>6. etc.... what everelse would be fair&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I think it would be fun and raise some awareness for the preorder</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So if I had to guess I bet on GTG growing more and would presale 5101 Villian sets</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
